# Line-ending policy: LF in the repo, LF on checkout, machine-independent.
# This makes the user's core.autocrlf setting irrelevant for this repo:
# - fresh clones on any machine check out LF (Radiant/GSC/linker all accept LF)
# - Radiant re-saves .map files with CRLF on Windows; commit normalizes back
#   to LF so the repo never churns line endings.
# Verified state 2026-06-12: every tracked text file is already LF in index
# and worktree (zero CR bytes), so adding this causes no renormalization.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries - never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
